    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME organised a 'normal birth' simulation for Nursing year III students, using the hi-fidelity simulator Victoria. The aim was to help students gain confidence in managing uncomplicated situations and to recognize the early development of any emergency in either mother or child.",
